daughter of the Nonomiya family and the school nurse at the school Hiroya attends. She also teaches the subject of sexuality between men and women in the \"Love Community Studies\" course. Due to her cool appearance and straightforward way of speaking, she is popular with students, and female students often come to her for advice about their troubles during lunch break. She scolds them properly when they do something wrong."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although she thinks she is quite strict with Hiroya, she also has some lenient sides, such as buying him the latest model smartphone. Even though they are not related by blood, she regards them as \"sister and brother,\" and she disciplines herself by never overstepping that line."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Whatever a brother does is my responsibility as an older sister. It is my duty as an older sister to guide him.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from DLsite"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c88909"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"野々宮家の長女で、弘矢が通う学園の養護教諭。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「らぶこみゅ学」の男女の性に関する分野の教科担当も兼ねている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目のクールさとサバサバした物言いから生徒達からの人気が高く昼休みに女子生徒に悩みを相談されることが多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"悪いことは悪いときちんと叱る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"弘矢に対して本人はかなり厳しく接しているつもりだが、最新の機種のスマホを買い与えたりと甘いところもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"弘矢とは血が繋がっていなくても“姉と弟”という関係であり、それを踏み越えることがあってはならないと自らを律している。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22767","sourceWorkId":"29258","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"野々宮家の長女で、弘矢が通う学園の養護教諭。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「らぶこみゅ学」の男女の性に関する分野の教科担当も兼ねている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目のクールさとサバサバした物言いから生徒達からの人気が高く"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"昼休みに女子生徒に悩みを相談されることが多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"悪いことは悪いときちんと叱る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"弘矢に対して本人はかなり厳しく接しているつもりだが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最新の機種のスマホを買い与えたりと甘いところもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"弘矢とは血が繋がっていなくても “姉と弟” という関係であり、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それを踏み越えることがあってはならないと自らを律している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「弟のすることは姉の責任だからな。導いてやるのが姉としての責務だ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"87198"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"87198","value":"ぬいぐるみ集め（皆には内緒にしている）"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f2/f2a6e054a417f6df28b3b8962348a08e1ec803a82ca8d896657f19c34ec6b794.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/57/573e29948d11ff72987814c1ec56adc3ced772897f426c34f47ae1feefa90d6d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"月森ねね","creatorId":"vndb:s12563","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s12563","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s12563","name":"月森 ねね","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:303557:87198:25284:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c88910","characterName":"野々宮 空","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"87199","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"303557"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22768"],"vndbCharacterId":"c88910"},"originalCharacterName":"野々宮 空","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"pending-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"303"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"96"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"H"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"162"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"92"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"60"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"野々宮家の次女で、弘矢が通う学園の副理事長だが現在は理事長が不在のため代理をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、数学教師であり主人公のクラスだけ担当している。"},{"spoiler":fa